<metadata preset-name="Synth Body" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A parallel split: the guitar lane runs the boost and the British master-volume head into a 4x12 and is then shelved hard below about 180 Hz, while a tracked sub synth supplies the whole low register. The amp gives the grind, the synth gives the body, and neither is a sound on its own. Body ↔ Grind balances them." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
